@startuml ABU-SSO Use Case Diagram
title ABU-SSO — Use Case Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor Student
actor Staff
actor Admin
actor "Third-Party Service" as TPS

rectangle "ABU-SSO" {
  usecase "UC-01 Register Account" as UC01
  usecase "UC-02 Log In" as UC02
  usecase "UC-03 View Profile" as UC03
  usecase "UC-04 View Digital ID Card" as UC04
  usecase "UC-05 Top Up Wallet" as UC05
  usecase "UC-06 Pay from Wallet" as UC06
  usecase "UC-07 View Transaction History" as UC07
  usecase "UC-08 SSO to Third-Party Service" as UC08
  usecase "UC-09 Administer Users" as UC09
  usecase "UC-10 Health Check" as UC10
}

Student --> UC01
Student --> UC02
Student --> UC03
Student --> UC04
Student --> UC05
Student --> UC06
Student --> UC07
Student --> UC08

Staff --> UC01
Staff --> UC02
Staff --> UC03
Staff --> UC04
Staff --> UC05
Staff --> UC06
Staff --> UC07
Staff --> UC08

Admin --> UC09
Admin --> UC03

TPS --> UC08

note right of UC08
  Third-party services trust
  the JWT issued by ABU-SSO,
  enabling single sign-on.
end note

@enduml